AI Diffusion for PhotoCraft
===========================

AI Diffusion for PhotoCraft is a modified version of Krita AI Diffusion
(https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion), copyright Krita AI Diffusion
contributors, licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3.
The modified work is distributed under the same license; see LICENSE.

Base version: Krita AI Diffusion v1.54.0-pre (commit 828b70c). Its full history
is part of this repository's history.

Modifications: this project adapts Krita AI Diffusion to run as an
out-of-process plug-in for PhotoCraft. Every file changed from upstream is
listed, with the reason, in UPSTREAM-CHANGES.md. Code added by this project
lives in photocraft_host/, packaging/ and tests/photocraft/.

Third-party components kept from upstream, under their own licenses:
- ai_diffusion/websockets: python-websockets 14.2 (BSD 3-Clause License)
- ai_diffusion/debugpy: debugpy 1.8.20 (MIT License), development only

PhotoCraft is a separate program by its own authors, licensed MIT OR
Apache-2.0 (https://github.com/storytold/photocraft). This plug-in talks to it
only through PhotoCraft's process plug-in protocol and contains no PhotoCraft
code. "Krita" and "PhotoCraft" are used here only to name the programs this
work comes from and runs in.
